{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27648","headline":"昭君怨二首 一 · 张祜","name":"昭君怨二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里边城远，千山行路难。\n举头唯见日，何处是长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}